            "code": "\tnodeID \u003d value[\"nodeID\"]\t\n\tdb \u003d value[\"db\"]\n\t\n\ttablenode \u003d mes_core.model.nodeTable(db)\n\tcolumns \u003d [\"Topic\"]\n\twhere_clause \u003d \"ID \u003d ?\"\n\twhere_args \u003d [nodeID]\n\tds \u003d tablenode.selectCustom(columns,where_clause,where_args)\n\t\n\ttopic \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,0)\n\t\n\t\n\treturn topic",
            "type": "script"
          }
        ],
        "type": "expr-struct"
      },
      "persistent": true
    },
